WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.330
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:01.600 --> 00:02.600
You?

3
00:03.040 --> 00:04.040
You're up.

4
00:10.080 --> 00:11.080
Mm.

5
00:14.680 --> 00:15.680
Song Yi.

6
00:18.720 --> 00:19.160
What's wrong?

7
00:19.560 --> 00:20.560
Eat up.

8
00:21.040 --> 00:22.360
He's Song Yi.

9
00:23.520 --> 00:24.520
Oh.

10
00:30.400 --> 00:31.839
You got drunk last night

11
00:31.840 --> 00:33.119
and after I got you home

12
00:33.120 --> 00:34.520
the drink hit me too

13
00:34.640 --> 00:36.240
so I fell asleep on the couch.

14
00:38.920 --> 00:39.920
Then you...

15
00:41.200 --> 00:42.200
Oh

16
00:42.319 --> 00:43.319
you mean breakfast?

17
00:43.560 --> 00:44.480
I was up early

18
00:44.480 --> 00:45.160
so

19
00:45.160 --> 00:46.160
I just made some.

20
00:48.000 --> 00:49.520
I remember last night

21
00:50.240 --> 00:51.920
you didn't say a word

22
00:52.160 --> 00:53.160
I thought you…

23
00:54.680 --> 00:55.680
Here

24
00:56.080 --> 00:57.600
let's have breakfast.

25
01:00.200 --> 01:01.200
Mm.

26
01:08.400 --> 01:09.400
Eat up.

27
01:49.040 --> 01:50.480
There was someone once

28
01:53.280 --> 01:55.320
who made me breakfast every day too.

29
02:08.080 --> 02:09.080
Huh.

30
02:09.920 --> 02:10.920
Is that so?

31
02:12.320 --> 02:13.439
That person

32
02:13.440 --> 02:14.720
must've been good to you.

33
02:21.280 --> 02:22.880
He was good to me.

34
02:23.920 --> 02:25.160
So good that...

35
02:26.480 --> 02:28.520
I came to depend on him.

36
02:30.640 --> 02:31.960
So good that...

37
02:33.680 --> 02:35.520
when he left...

38
02:38.200 --> 02:39.200
I almost

39
02:40.040 --> 02:41.800
stopped breathing.

40
03:09.840 --> 03:11.040
Song Yi.

41
03:19.920 --> 03:22.080
You finally came back.

42
04:01.520 --> 04:02.520
I'm sorry.

43
04:09.680 --> 04:11.280
It's enough that you're back.

44
04:26.320 --> 04:27.320
Mm.

45
04:28.040 --> 04:29.040
I'm back.

46
04:42.520 --> 04:43.520
Song Yi.

47
04:43.760 --> 04:44.760
Mm.

48
04:51.880 --> 04:53.680
So that's how ugly you look.

49
04:59.880 --> 05:01.560
Is this what you imagined?

50
05:03.440 --> 05:04.480
No.

51
05:05.160 --> 05:06.320
In my imagination

52
05:07.360 --> 05:09.360
you were a guide dog.

53
05:17.760 --> 05:19.200
Then I'll be your guide dog forever.

54
05:19.520 --> 05:20.240
Okay.

55
05:20.520 --> 05:21.520
Mm.

56
05:21.760 --> 05:23.360
No taking it back.

57
05:27.560 --> 05:28.920
Sometimes?

58
05:30.800 --> 05:32.400
No sometimes.

59
05:34.680 --> 05:35.680
Fine.

60
05:35.920 --> 05:37.160
No sometimes.

61
05:38.360 --> 05:39.360
Mm.

62
06:43.160 --> 06:44.160
Mom.

63
06:44.880 --> 06:45.880
Auntie Xu.

64
06:50.480 --> 06:51.480
Mm.

65
06:51.800 --> 06:52.800
Sit down.

66
06:53.240 --> 06:53.880
Yes, yes.

67
06:53.960 --> 06:55.000
Come sit down.

68
06:55.720 --> 06:56.720
Sit.

69
07:01.120 --> 07:02.879
It's been ages since we got together

70
07:02.880 --> 07:03.840
so this is perfect;

71
07:03.841 --> 07:06.080
I thought I'd treat everyone to dinner.

72
07:07.440 --> 07:08.440
Feiyu

73
07:08.520 --> 07:09.960
don't sit there scowling.

74
07:10.320 --> 07:12.320
You haven't seen Sister Yun in nine months.

75
07:12.960 --> 07:13.960
So you go first

76
07:14.080 --> 07:15.279
toast Sister Yun

77
07:15.280 --> 07:16.280
and apologize.

78
07:16.440 --> 07:16.920
No need.

79
07:16.920 --> 07:17.920
I...

80
07:19.520 --> 07:20.560
Feiyu.

81
07:21.320 --> 07:22.960
No matter where you hide

82
07:23.400 --> 07:25.400
you're still my most beloved son.

83
07:29.480 --> 07:30.480
Mm.

84
07:33.360 --> 07:34.360
Auntie Xu.

85
07:36.866 --> 07:38.306
Before we eat...

86
07:39.680 --> 07:41.239
I want to make everything clear.

87
07:41.240 --> 07:42.600
Can it wait till after dinner?

88
07:42.857 --> 07:45.440
The food's getting cold. Hold your horses, let's eat first.

89
07:45.640 --> 07:46.560
Come on, eat.

90
07:46.560 --> 07:47.560
Let him speak.

91
08:05.680 --> 08:07.120
From today on.

92
08:08.720 --> 08:10.200
I'm going to stay here.

93
08:15.680 --> 08:16.680
Auntie Xu.

94
08:18.720 --> 08:19.720
Is that all right?

95
08:43.360 --> 08:44.360
All right.

96
08:52.480 --> 08:53.480
Auntie Xu.

97
08:53.680 --> 08:54.760
Thank you for accepting me.

98
08:55.440 --> 08:56.440
Let me offer you a toast.

99
08:58.800 --> 09:01.280
Mom... I...

100
09:09.280 --> 09:10.400
My son.

101
09:11.880 --> 09:13.280
No matter what you do.

102
09:14.080 --> 09:15.280
Mom loves you.

103
09:16.800 --> 09:18.840
All Mom wants is for you

104
09:19.480 --> 09:20.880
to always be happy

105
09:22.880 --> 09:23.880
and joyful.

106
09:29.600 --> 09:30.440
Come on now

107
09:30.441 --> 09:32.280
I'll join in too.

108
10:57.920 --> 10:59.520
Didn't you quit smoking?

109
11:00.240 --> 11:01.680
I did for a while.

110
11:03.279 --> 11:05.359
Then at an antique shop in Europe,

111
11:05.880 --> 11:08.382
I saw another lighter exactly like this one.

112
11:13.320 --> 11:14.920
I couldn't resist lighting one.

113
11:18.080 --> 11:19.560
So you took it up again?

114
11:21.240 --> 11:22.240
Yeah.

115
11:24.120 --> 11:25.120
Mm.

116
11:26.120 --> 11:27.320
Every time I missed you.

117
11:37.120 --> 11:41.326
That lighter just like this one... did you buy it?

118
11:44.400 --> 11:45.400
No.

119
11:48.000 --> 11:49.280
It looked like it

120
11:50.240 --> 11:51.520
but it wasn't the one.

121
11:54.240 --> 11:55.240
And besides.

122
11:55.960 --> 11:59.120
I didn't dare to keep looking at it.

123
12:04.320 --> 12:07.096
It made my chest hurt, the guilt choking me...

124
12:07.120 --> 12:08.120
Song Yi.

125
12:10.320 --> 12:11.600
You came back

126
12:13.680 --> 12:15.560
but all of this feels

127
12:17.280 --> 12:18.880
so unreal.

128
12:28.320 --> 12:29.320
It's real.

129
12:30.560 --> 12:32.000
All of this is real.

130
12:35.680 --> 12:36.680
Mm.

131
12:39.000 --> 12:40.320
Really feel it.

132
13:00.080 --> 13:01.080
It's you.

133
13:01.920 --> 13:02.920
It's you.

134
13:03.800 --> 13:04.800
Song Yi.

135
13:05.840 --> 13:07.200
It's really you...

136
13:07.760 --> 13:08.760
It's me.

137
13:10.840 --> 13:11.840
It's really me.

138
13:20.720 --> 13:22.720
Let me get a good look at you.

139
13:24.520 --> 13:25.520
Mm.

140
13:51.920 --> 13:52.920
Mm.
